SUMMARY:Spencer Jones: The Experimental Kids Show
LOCATION:Pálás Screen 1\, Merchants Road\, Galway\, Galway
DESCRIPTION:BAFTA-nominated Spencer Jones\, twice Edinburgh Comedy Award-no
 minated\, unleashes an hour of wild\, no-story visual comedy – daft music
 \, surreal props\, bonkers energy – where anything can happen and usually
  does. Expect a chaotic mix of clowning\, silly stories\, puppets\, nonsens
 e and unpredictable mayhem from one of the Fringe’s most gloriously silly
  minds. Kids will love it\, adults will laugh just as hard – no family re
 quired. If you like your comedy strange\, joyful and completely unhinged\, 
 this is the show for you. A rare chance to see pure imagination run riot on
  stage.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/spencer-jone
 s-the-experimental-kids-show/
